# =============================================================================
# geometry/2D_regolith_pore_divots.opts — regolith pore channel (implicit regolith).
# Generated by preprocess/build_geometry_regolith_pore.py (deterministic).
# Study: studies/icy_regolith/implicit_pore_domain/ (Effort 1).
#
# Two-sided channel whose top/bottom walls are 12+12 lunar-regolith
# grains (R_med=5.0e-05 m), with a central throat pinch (min gap
# 48% Ly at x=0.51Lx). Ice placement strategy:
# 'wall_divots' -> 12 ice grains in the pore space. The regolith
# is the deformed boundary, NOT a simulated field (that is Effort 2).
#
# WALL DIVOTS. 6 floor + 6 ceiling smooth depressions are carved
# into the walls, one per ice grain, each depth 0.5*R_ice and half-width
# 1.75*R_ice, so every grain sits nestled in a seat of its own size rather
# than perched on a bare wall. A divot is just another C-infinity bump with
# NEGATIVE height in the -sed_grain_*/-top_grain_* lists below, so the wall
# stays C-infinity and the solver needs no special handling.
#
# Divots cost mesh slope budget, so this geometry uses SOFTER regolith relief
# (h/R 0.22-0.36 vs 0.35-0.60 for the other strategies) and a higher
# central amplification to keep a real throat. Carved slopes are 47/47 deg
# (floor/ceiling), within the 48 deg budget.
#
# Because the walls differ, this geometry has its OWN mesh — it does not share
# inputs/geometry/meshes/regolith_pore.dat with flank_caps/throat_bridge/pore_lining.
#
# eps=8.5840e-07 is the comp_eps.py (Kaempfer&Plapp) value for T=-20C,
# alpha_c=0.01341 (kinetic-bound limited, so grain-size independent here;
# eps/R_smallest=4.1% < 5%). Reproduces the validated
# ripening_2D_L1.01mm_eps0.86um_2sided reference exactly. PAIR ONLY with a T=-20C
# experiment (e.g. base_T-20_h1.00_30d_a1.34e-2, which sets the matching
# beta_sub0/d0_sub0). RECOMPUTE eps for any other run temperature.
# =============================================================================
# DOF_GRID: 1344 446
-geom_file inputs/geometry/meshes/regolith_pore_divots.dat
-p 2
-C 1
-ic_type multi_grains
-dim 2
-Lx 8.140000e-04
-Ly 2.693300e-04
-Lz 0
-sed_grain_x 0.000000e+00,7.941967e-05,1.522212e-04,2.141634e-04,2.828607e-04,3.634666e-04,4.502809e-04,5.227176e-04,5.980717e-04,6.726248e-04,7.482771e-04,8.140000e-04,1.207602e-04,2.196914e-04,3.389962e-04,4.661935e-04,6.176189e-04,7.152653e-04
-sed_grain_R 4.458082e-05,6.786241e-05,3.631909e-05,4.572932e-05,6.734930e-05,1.549273e-04,1.366497e-04,8.415336e-05,4.742019e-05,6.195996e-05,3.910769e-05,4.365717e-05,5.250000e-05,4.025000e-05,5.250000e-05,5.250000e-05,5.250000e-05,3.850000e-05
-sed_grain_h 1.484053e-05,1.921501e-05,1.244853e-05,1.391237e-05,2.226139e-05,3.814876e-05,3.611257e-05,2.295189e-05,1.371334e-05,1.772956e-05,1.310676e-05,1.066312e-05,-1.500000e-05,-1.150000e-05,-1.500000e-05,-1.500000e-05,-1.500000e-05,-1.100000e-05
-top_grain_x 0.000000e+00,7.503075e-05,1.378210e-04,2.051421e-04,2.899667e-04,3.710227e-04,4.303151e-04,5.014467e-04,5.869230e-04,6.793556e-04,7.538250e-04,8.140000e-04,1.064436e-04,2.356599e-04,3.556989e-04,5.344726e-04,6.297329e-04,7.193033e-04
-top_grain_R 5.859734e-05,4.799347e-05,3.750054e-05,5.730887e-05,1.000759e-04,1.095854e-04,1.208211e-04,1.024572e-04,7.029916e-05,6.677567e-05,3.940769e-05,4.144967e-05,5.250000e-05,4.725000e-05,5.250000e-05,5.250000e-05,3.675000e-05,4.550000e-05
